DESCRIPTION:The Don Rogers Band is an Australian country rock four-piece le
 d by singer-songwriter Don Rogers from Queensland’s Gold Coast. Blending
  outlaw country with rock ’n’ roll grit\, the band delivers big hooks\
 , raw vocals\, and high-energy live shows. Their debut single “Light It 
 Up” introduces a bold\, guitar-driven sound rooted in real stories and m
 odern country rock attitude.
